<p>Raw magical damage channels through the caster's weapon, increasing raw Physical Power by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 33%, 48%, 60%, 71%</acronym> of your Magic (current bonus: <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100,<br>spellpower 100">14, 33, 48, 60, 71</acronym>).</p><p>Each time you crit with a melee blow, you will unleash a radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 1, 1, 2</acronym> ball of arcane damage, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Magic 100,<br>spellpower 100">59, 79, 95, 108, 120.</acronym></p><p>The bonus scales with your Spellpower and talent level.</p><p>If you are using a shield this will only occur 50% of the time.</p><p>If you are dual wielding this will only occur 50% of the time.</p><p>At level 5 the ball becomes radius 2.</p><p></p>